## Commands
- Build: `docker compose up --build` (healthy: `Build succeeded`)
- Test: `pytest -q` backend, `cd frontend && npm run test` frontend (healthy: all green)
- Lint: `ruff check .` + `mypy backend/` / `npm run lint` + `npx tsc --noEmit` (healthy: zero warnings)

