- [e.g. Python 3.12, Pydantic v2. Money is BigDecimal, never float.]
- [e.g. No new Lombok / no dependency bumps without platform sign-off.]

## Architecture
- `backend/` routers → services → models; `frontend/` components → hooks → lib
- [Schemas, events, generated dirs, frozen legacy paths — never edit generated.]

## Things Claude gets wrong
